== Overview ==

The decision and rendering logic behind the song-list freshness box. This module is '''pure''': it never touches <code>mw</code>, takes the current date as an argument rather than reading the clock, and returns strings. That makes it testable outside the wiki, and keeps every threshold and wording choice in one readable place.

It is required by [[Module:Freshness]], which supplies everything that does need <code>mw</code>.

